  "content": "<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n<div class=\"bg-center bg-cover wb-init wb-bgimg-inited\" data-bgimg-srcset=\"https://wet-boew.github.io/vocab/wb/utilities#no-image 992w, &#10;                                                   /content/dam/pch/images/ip-banner/Web-banner-520x200.png 1700w,&#10;                                                   /content/dam/pch/images/ip-banner/Web-banner-1200x726.png 1920w\" id=\"wb-auto-4\" style=\"background-image: url('../content/dam/pch/images/ip-banner/Web-banner-520x200.png');\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-7\">\n<h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\" dir=\"ltr\">Canadian Heritage</h1>\n<p>The Department of Canadian Heritage and its Portfolio organizations play a vital role in the cultural, civic and economic life of Canadians. Our policies and programs promote an environment where Canadians can experience dynamic cultural expressions, celebrate our history and heritage and build strong communities. The Department invests in the future by supporting the arts, our official and Indigenous languages, multiculturalism and our athletes and the sport system.</p>\n<p><a class=\"btn btn-call-to-action\" href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/funding.html\">Apply for funding</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"gc-featured-link wb-init gc-featured-link-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-5\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Spotlight on</h2>\n<div data-wb-randomize=\"{ &quot;shuffle&quot;: true, &quot;selector&quot;: &quot;p&quot;, &quot;toggle&quot;: &quot;hide&quot;}\" class=\"wb-init wb-randomize-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-6\">\n<p class=\"hide\"><a class=\"stretched-link\" href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/campaigns/asian-heritage-month.html?utm_campaign=pch-pch-ahm---mpa-26-27&amp;utm_medium=pog&amp;utm_source=pch&amp;utm_content=ahm2026-en-260501\">Celebrate Asian Heritage Month in May</a></p>\n<p class=\"\"><a class=\"stretched-link\" href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/campaigns/soccer-2026.html?utm_campaign=pch-pch-fifa26-2025-2026&amp;utm_medium=canada-ca&amp;utm_source=pch-lv&amp;utm_content=web-promos-en-260603\">Canada welcomes the FIFA World Cup 2026™</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"gc-most-requested\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2>Most requested</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/anthem-canada.html\">National anthem of Canada</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/half-masting-notices.html\">National Flag of Canada half-masting notices</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/how-rights-protected/guide-canadian-charter-rights-freedoms.html\">Guide to the Canadian Charter of Rights and Freedoms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/important-commemorative-days.html\">Important and commemorative days</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/official-symbols-canada.html\">Official symbols of Canada</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/flag-canada-history.html\">The history of the National Flag of Canada</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/protocol-guidelines-special-event/styles-address.html\">Styles of address</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/official-languages-bilingualism/publications/statistics.html\">Statistics on official languages in Canada</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"container mrgn-bttm-lg\">\n<section class=\"gc-srvinfo\">\n<h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/funding.html\">Funding</a></h3>\n<p>Apply to one of a myriad of funding programs that support culture, history, heritage, sport and official languages in Canada.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/events-celebrations-commemorations.html\">Events, celebrations and commemorations</a></h3>\n<p>Show your pride for this amazing country by participating in our many events and celebrations and by commemorating important moments and people in Canadian history.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/canadian-identity-society/anthems-symbols.html\">Anthems and symbols of Canada</a></h3>\n<p>Get information about the melodies, objects and flags that have become – through traditional usage or by public perception – the symbols by which Canadians identify themselves.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/canadian-identity-society/languages.html\">Languages</a></h3>\n<p>Learn more about our official languages as well as the variety of Indigenous languages spoken nationwide.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/canadian-identity-society/monarchy-crown.html\">Monarchy and the Crown</a></h3>\n<p>Get a better understanding of how the Crown remains a fundamental part of Canada's system of government and our sense of identity.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/canadian-identity-society/human-rights.html\">Human rights</a></h3>\n<p>Know your rights as a Canadian citizen, understand how your rights are protected, and learn how to file a complaint if you have been discriminated against.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/events-celebrations-commemorations/experience-canada-capital/events-capital.html\">Major events in Canada’s Capital Region</a></h3>\n<p>Experience the major events that bring Canada's Capital Region to life through history, culture and celebration.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/canadian-identity-society/multiculturalism.html\">Multiculturalism</a></h3>\n<p>Discover the significance of multiculturalism in Canada — ensuring that all citizens keep their identities, take pride in their ancestry and have a sense of belonging.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/sport.html\">Sport</a></h3>\n<p>Learn how our sport programs provide Canadians with access to sport as part of a healthy and active lifestyle, and help athletes participate and succeed in competitions.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/history-heritage/museology-conservation.html\">Museology and conservation</a></h3>\n<p>Explore the expertise and services available to heritage institutions and professionals, including collections management and the preservation and conservation of cultural objects and artefacts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/canadian-identity-society/creation-canada.html\">The creation of Canada</a></h3>\n<p>Learn about the original inhabitants of Canada, the origin of our country's name, the Fathers of Confederation and the events and milestones that shaped our country's creation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/arts-media.html\">Arts and media</a></h3>\n<p>Explore funding opportunities, and information and services available in the arts and media industries, including festivals, music, book publishing, film and more.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/cultural-youth-programs.html\">Cultural youth programs</a></h3>\n<p>Enjoy learning and adventure, friendship and discovery as you take part in student or graduate jobs, internships and language immersion programs.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/cultural-trade-investment.html\">Cultural trade and investment</a></h3>\n<p>Discover the programs, policies and regulations in place to support the acquisition or preservation of cultural objects and media industries for the long-term benefit of Canadians.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/cultural-attractions/museums-galleries.html\">Museums and galleries</a></h3>\n<p>Visit a national museum or gallery, get a Museums Passport or apply for funding through one of our many programs designed to support heritage institutions.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/services/culture/history-heritage/movable-cultural-property.html\">Movable cultural property</a></h3>\n<p>Discover how Canada supports the preservation of artistic, historic and scientific heritage through designation, tax certification, grants and by regulating the import and export of cultural property.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"well well-sm brdr-0 mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<section>\n<h2>Contact us</h2>\n<ul class=\"wb-eqht list-unstyled mrgn-tp-lg lst-spcd-2 colcount-md-3 bold-content wb-init wb-eqht-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-7\">\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 33px;\"><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/contact-us.html\">General enquiries</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 33px;\"><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/contact-ministers-offices.html\">Minister and Secretary of State</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 33px;\"><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/contact-media.html\">Media enquiries</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 33px;\"><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/services/funding/report-fraud-abuse.html\">Report fraud or abuse</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 33px;\"><a href=\"../en/conservation-institute/corporate/contact.html\">Canadian Conservation Institute</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 65px;\"><a href=\"../en/heritage-information-network/corporate/contact.html\">Canadian Heritage Information Network</a></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n<section>\n<h2>About Canadian Heritage</h2>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled bold-content mrgn-tp-lg lst-spcd-2 colcount-md-2\">\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/mandate.html\">Mandate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/organization-structure.html\">Organizational structure</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/portfolio-organizations.html\">Portfolio</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/transparency.html\">Transparency</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page2440?classificationInfos=&amp;locationsFilter=&amp;officialLanguage=&amp;title=&amp;tab=2&amp;search=Search%20jobs&amp;selectionProcessNumber=&amp;departments=93&amp;log=false&amp;toggleLanguage=en\">Job opportunities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/ministerial-council-appointments.html\">Appointment opportunities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/accessibility.html\">Accessibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/legislation.html\">Acts and regulations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/publications.html\">Publications and statistics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/corporate/public-consultations.html\">Consultations</a></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n<section class=\"gc-followus\">\n<h2>On social media</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"external\" href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/subscribe-newsletters.html\"><span class=\"fas fa-envelope fa-lg mrgn-lft-sm mrgn-rght-sm\"></span> Subscribe to our newsletters</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#instagram\" class=\"instagram wb-lbx wb-init wb-lbx-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-8\">Instagram</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#facebook\" class=\"facebook wb-lbx wb-init wb-lbx-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-9\">Facebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#youtube\" class=\"youtube wb-lbx wb-init wb-lbx-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-10\">YouTube</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/canadian-heritage-patrimoine-canadien/\" class=\"linkedin\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">LinkedIn: </span>Canadian Heritage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#x-social\" class=\"x-social wb-lbx wb-init wb-lbx-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-11\">X<span class=\"wb-inv\">, formerly known as Twitter</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section id=\"instagram\" class=\"modal-dialog modal-content overlay-def mfp-hide\">\n<div class=\"modal-body\">\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled lst-spcd\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cdn.heritage/\" rel=\"external\">@cdn.heritage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/winterludeca/\" rel=\"external\">@winterludeca</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sportcanada.en/\" rel=\"external\">@sportcanada.en</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"facebook\" class=\"modal-dialog modal-content overlay-def mfp-hide\">\n<div class=\"modal-body\">\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled lst-spcd\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CdnHeritage\" rel=\"external\">Canadian Heritage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/winterludeca\" rel=\"external\">Winterlude</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/SportCanadaEN\" rel=\"external\">Sport Canada (EN)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheCrownCa\" rel=\"external\">The Crown in Canada</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"youtube\" class=\"modal-dialog modal-content overlay-def mfp-hide\">\n<div class=\"modal-body\">\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled lst-spcd\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/CdnHeritage\" rel=\"external\">Cdn Heritage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Sport_Canada\" rel=\"external\">Sport Canada</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"x-social\" class=\"modal-dialog modal-content overlay-def mfp-hide\">\n<div class=\"modal-body\">\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled lst-spcd\">\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/CdnHeritage\" rel=\"external\">@CdnHeritage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/SportCanada_EN\" rel=\"external\">@SportCanada_EN</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/TheCrownCa\" rel=\"external\">@TheCrownCA</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<section class=\"gc-minister\">\n<h2>Minister</h2>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/government/ministers/marc-miller.html\">The Honourable Marc Miller</a></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/ministers/marc-miller.jpg\" alt=\"The Honourable Marc Miller\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7\">\n<p>Minister of Canadian Identity and Culture and Minister responsible for Official Languages</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2>Secretary of State</h2>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n<h3><a href=\"../en/government/secretaries-of-state/adam-van-koeverden.html\">The Honourable Adam van Koeverden</a></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/ministers/adam-van-koeverden.jpg\" alt=\"The Honourable Adam van Koeverden\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7\">\n<p>Secretary of State (Sport)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2>Parliamentary secretaries</h2>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n<h3>Madeleine Chenette</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/ministers/madeleine-chenette.jpg\" alt=\"Madeleine Chenette\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7\">\n<p>Parliamentary Secretary to the Minister of Canadian Identity and Culture and Minister responsible for Official Languages and Parliamentary Secretary to the Secretary of State (Sport)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n<h3>David Myles</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/ministers/david-myles.jpg\" alt=\"David Myles\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7\">\n<p>Parliamentary Secretary to the Minister of Canadian Identity and Culture and Minister responsible for Official Languages and Parliamentary Secretary to the Secretary of State (Nature)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n<section class=\"wb-feeds limit-3 wb-init wb-feeds-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-12\">\n<h2>News</h2>\n<ul class=\"feeds-cont list-unstyled lst-spcd\">\n<li><a data-ajax=\"https://api.io.canada.ca/io-server/gc/news/en/v2?dept=canadianheritage&amp;sort=publishedDate&amp;orderBy=desc&amp;pick=3\" href=\"https://api.io.canada.ca/io-server/gc/news/en/v2?dept=canadianheritage&amp;sort=publishedDate&amp;orderBy=desc&amp;pick=3&amp;format=atom&amp;atomtitle=Canada%20News%20Centre%20-%20Canadian%20Heritage\" id=\"wb-auto-13\">Government of Canada News Releases</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>More: <a href=\"../en/news/advanced-news-search/news-results.html?_=1745326116059&amp;dprtmnt=canadianheritage&amp;start=&amp;end=\">Canadian Heritage news</a></p>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n<section class=\"gc-features\">\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n<div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-14\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/features/spring-economic-update-360x203.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n<h3><a href=\"https://budget.canada.ca/update-miseajour/2026/home-accueil-en.html\" class=\"stretched-link\">Spring Economic Update 2026</a></h3>\n<p>The government’s plan to build, protect, and empower Canada amid global uncertainty.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n<div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-15\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/features/cda-strong-pass-summer-edition-2026-360x203.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n<h3><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/campaigns/canada-pass.html\" class=\"stretched-link\">Your Canadian summer starts here</a></h3>\n<p>Free or discounted museums, parks, campsites and trains from June 19 to September 7. Plan your adventure now.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n<div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-16\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/features/fifa-2026-360x203.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n<h3><a href=\"../en/canadian-heritage/campaigns/soccer-2026.html?utm_campaign=pch-pch-fifa26-2025-2026&amp;utm_medium=canada-ca&amp;utm_source=pch-ev&amp;utm_content=web-promos-en-260201\" class=\"stretched-link\">Canada welcomes the FIFA World Cup 2026™</a></h3>\n<p>Make the most of the event and discover the best of Canada. Consult the resources for fans, travellers and businesses.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n<div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-17\"><img src=\"../content/dam/pch/images/features/census-2026-360x203.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.census.gc.ca/en/index?utm_source=canadian-heritage-web-tile&amp;utm_medium=vurl&amp;utm_campaign=statcan-statcan-2026-genpop-collection-26-27&amp;utm_content=federal-partners-en-census-wrapper\">The 2026 Census is underway</a></h3>\n<p>Census collection is underway across the country. Find information on how to complete your census.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
}